3721307959_8173778540486773788_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CnFB5-VJLxEQ7kNvwEwEWZT&_nc_oc=AdqT0PSRc_wdf2iGkr2xbTdINlwOLQ2hD53K1-DyQqb15SBV-WbtztJXn3pZNAgmC5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOE2aWmk-i6JJrxbkQfEbaDA69nHOkxrR6pqEJADsVx2A&oe=6AE1F46D"}, {"file_name": "com.oculus.vrshell-20260928-045756_2560x1440.png", "id": "1124924116734857", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624606_1124924120068190_1613909125689018765_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q5JldCNtdYkQ7kNvwGMq5-h&_nc_oc=Adr5gjbpquCwyaEWWbzAceGgi1arBAV0NSdLW_Vo_t-ypmnhdZibxrqoiieLyWAoySs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOGZ63LTatN6WkZMj6g7870NDbB2HNdgtFsFMfkghQjJw&oe=6AE20054"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Stealth Keyboard", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Stealth Keyboard is a distraction-free, zero-UI inline Japanese Input Method (IME) optimized for physical Bluetooth and USB keyboards on Meta Quest.\n\n### Key Features\n* **Zero-UI Inline Typing**: Visual input overlays and candidate windows are completely hidden, preserving full visibility of your VR workspace and text editors.\n* **Smart Conversion Engine**: High-accuracy Japanese conversion powered by open-source Mozc dictionary (over 1.28M words) supporting compound phrases, inflections, and Katakana-to-English translation.\n* **F6\u2013F10 Function Key Shortcuts**:\n  - F6: Hiragana\n  - F7: Full-width Katakana\n  - F8: Half-width Katakana\n  - F9: Full-width Alphanumeric\n  - F10: Half-width Alphanumeric\n* **100% Offline & Private**: Zero internet permissions requested. All conversions and keystrokes are processed strictly on-device without any data collection.", "short_description": "A completely invisible (No-UI) inline Japanese IME designed for Meta Quest 3, 3S, and Pro. Type naturally with physical keyboards without any distracting visual overlays blocking your 